.png", "id": "2392553264515420", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823901_2392553267848753_4145866477164997808_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LM_syWad9GsQ7kNvwEp2Lef&_nc_oc=Adrn_V6RjFWwN04hgrtW71oaIsSJWQwmAvxanHKz-nXyx9Zgfi49fGH8RSbwsXluDWw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQST9Cx2UdzSRul6BpxC576XUVeMhSW6HlEwgLvad9QRQw&oe=6B0C4D0E"}, {"file_name": "27.png", "id": "849060007791741", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820387_849060011125074_4069190445085777822_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=foEXnjoGBzkQ7kNvwGy6o2D&_nc_oc=AdpB7JKN8uDLAlsUUdbpYxYBn7QcUhxBOJDAmVoFmpLIEWXT4G67BWZ29W00IkfniZA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRlGa64bFIKaxsr190H4ENWcbdNpGRCjubPxphpVLt9tw&oe=6B0C702C"}, {"file_name": "32.png", "id": "841714191676625", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300619_841714195009958_216825495650438070_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v5CV4ekk51kQ7kNvwH2elFy&_nc_oc=Adryu_j0WIg-UmWUQXd_7cjfeKxQpIyqya_rQ0vSunjkTwaeA7lJQvw4YSWdEmGuDaM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSo4eLrp3yH2-qdsWbt9sZTT8nm2yxds4PRVssW0m4TlA&oe=6B0C59EC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Landscape (2).png", "id": "1487203116629993", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604317775_1487203119963326_937934348911748853_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dWlEbgJkXHwQ7kNvwH9HbZN&_nc_oc=AdopgBBrkLnHJWjV1G26B3GtyirLGSClBIp8JbiCNWtKF-w7vststImSFhCytKzNEUI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTa6dOE-i9SUihBtr01NsdIxW_Ul9ddmHlc3dPUpU3e3A&oe=6B0C5E89"}, "display_name": "EGG VR T\u0130TAN", "keywords": ["scary", "baboon", "dino", "hero", "fun"], "long_description": "**Run, climb, and jump in VR using a unique Baboon Movement inspired by Gorilla Tag.**\n\n# \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Mini-Games \n\n**You can play different mini-games such as:**\n\n- **\ud83d\udc40 Squid Game**\n\n- **\ud83e\udd88 Steal a Monkey**\n\n- **\ud83d\udc7b Fun Horror Games**\n\n- **\ud83d\udc12 Hatch Egg**\n\n\n#  Steal a Brainrot\n\n**Steal Dino Brainrots and raise them and get rich**\n\n{2842365595962805}\n____________________________________________________________________.\n# \ud83d\udc7b Horror Mode\n\n**Run away from the Baboon Monster,  and fight against the boss**\n\n{851464257334354}\n\n____________________________________________________________________.\n#  \ud83e\udda0 Smash Mode\n\n**Tag Everyone and swing like a Gorilla or Baboon**\n\n{1317578033136114}\n____________________________________________________________________.\n#  \ud83e\udda0 Giant Mode\n{1554376978890768}\n____________________________________________________________________.\n# \ud83d\udd2b Shooter Mode\n\n**Play the best Rivals Shooter game**\n\n{25044154225189929}\n____________________________________________________________________.\n# \ud83d\udd2b NEW BOMBS and Mini Games\n\n**Get eggs and hatch them. Name and ride your chicken, snail, or your dino.**\n\n{4134103796903773}\n\n{1852341419024466}\n____________________________________________________________________.\n\nAnd try to survive in the new Forest in 99 nights, Egg VR 99 Nights Survive from Deer is Coming.\n\n# \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Mini-Games \n\n**You can play different mini-games such as:**\n\n- **\ud83d\udc40 Squid Game**\n\n- **\ud83e\udd88 Steal a Monkey**\n\n- **\ud83d\udc7b Fun Monkey Horror Games**\n\n- **\ud83d\udc12 Egg Smash**\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf1f Become an Egg!\n\n", "short_description": "Become an Egg VR Halloween, play all the popular Minigames."}]}, "developer_name": "FutureOfVR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://futureofvr.games/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Futur